From: Omarchy Mobile <omamobile@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8953-xiaomi-markw: restart charging at 4.18 V

With the default 100 mV recharge threshold the phone, left on a charger
at full, alternates between Full and Charging about once a minute and
keeps the battery at the top of its charge. Restart charging 200 mV below
the 4.38 V float instead.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dts |    1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dts
@@ -142,6 +142,7 @@
 	constant-charge-current-max-microamp = <1000000>;
 	voltage-min-design-microvolt = <3400000>;
 	voltage-max-design-microvolt = <4380000>;
+	re-charge-voltage-microvolt = <4180000>;
 };
 
 &camss {
